  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ICT4D Zambia - ZICTA</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICT4D in Zambia - ZICTA - ICT4D in Zambia - ZICTA strategy 2018-2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In order to track progress on the adoption of ICTs and how these technologies are used by individuals and households in the country ZICTA aims to undertake a national survey access and usage of ICTs, together with the Central Statistical Office (CSO). The survey should provide data on connectivity and basic use of ICT services as well as an understanding of barriers to, and drivers for use, and of what people are doning and not doing online (social media use, digital finance/mobile money, e-government services, working etc).</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Survey of ICT access and use in Zambia</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Unders&#xF6;kning av tillg&#xE5;ng till  och anv&#xE4;ndning av ICT-tj&#xE4;nster i Zambia</narrative>
  </description>
